    "body": "Yeah, of course.\r\n@pizzafox, could you also attach the output of this command?\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n find /sys/class/power_supply/battery/ -name '*' -print -exec cat {} \\;\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt is expected now that either `energy_full_design` or `charge_full_design` exist in the battery folder, which is probably not your case.",
